WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:04.796
♪♪

00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:05.797
What's up?

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:07.591
♪♪

00:00:07.591 --> 00:00:11.303
We're leaving you and Mythic
Quest.

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:12.471
No.

00:00:12.763 --> 00:00:13.764
Yes.

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:15.849
♪Work It Out,
Work It Out♪

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:17.267
♪Work, Work, Work It Out♪

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.685
♪Out♪

00:00:19.061 --> 00:00:20.187
♪Work...Work♪

00:00:20.187 --> 00:00:21.521
Have you ever spent any time in
the Metaverse?

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:22.648
♪♪

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:23.649
Oww!

00:00:23.649 --> 00:00:24.942
That's way above my pay-grade,
pal.

00:00:24.942 --> 00:00:26.276
♪♪

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.277
I'm just the janitor.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.820
(Excited screeching)

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:31.156
I got an NFT for ya: No
(beeping) Thanks.

00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:33.158
♪♪

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:34.743
Ian Elizabeth Grimm!

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:35.744
Is that his middle name?

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:36.745
IAN!

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:38.080
♪♪

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.624
There have been reports of
repeated harassment.

00:00:40.624 --> 00:00:41.208
From who?

00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:42.292
It's anonymous, David.

00:00:42.292 --> 00:00:43.043
It's her.

00:00:43.043 --> 00:00:44.127
That tracks.
-Yeah, that tracks.

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:46.296
Carol, can you tell Poppy to
stop acting like a cat?

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:48.340
I'm not acting like a cat, I'm
acting like (gags).

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:50.884
You see, Carol, these kind of
meetings did not happen when I
worked here.

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.511
We had this exact meeting.

00:00:52.511 --> 00:00:54.137
Carol, if I may?

00:00:54.137 --> 00:00:55.264
You may not.

00:00:55.264 --> 00:00:56.265
Yes, okay.

00:00:56.265 --> 00:00:57.266
♪Wor-wor-work it out♪

00:00:57.266 --> 00:00:58.433
♪♪

00:00:59.685 --> 00:01:00.686
It's an honor, Mr. Grimm.

00:01:01.186 --> 00:01:02.187
I'm a huge fan.

00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:03.522
I like this guy.

00:01:03.981 --> 00:01:04.982
Please kill me.

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:06.566
Really?

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:09.069
♪♪

